 r←Hello payload;name
⍝ Return a greeting for payload.name, e.g. {"name":"Ada"} gives {"greeting":"Hello, Ada!"}
⍝ If there is no name, greet "World"
 :If 9≠⌊⎕NC'payload' ⍝ no request body or query string: payload is '' rather than a namespace
     payload←⎕NS''
 :EndIf
 name←{6::'World' ⋄ ⍵.name}payload
⍝ v20: name←payload ⎕VGET ⊂'name' 'World'
 r←⎕NS''
 r.greeting←'Hello, ',(⍕name),'!'
⍝ v20: r←(greeting: 'Hello, ',(⍕name),'!')
